# Design & registration (planned)

## Figma UI/UX

- Current UI (black/white/gold, layout components) is an **interim foundation**, not final design.
- Future work will **align the site to Figma** (marketing, auth, dashboards). Prefer token-based updates to shared components over one-off page CSS.
- See `docs/DESIGN_AND_FORMS_ROADMAP.md` and ADR-009 in `docs/DECISIONS.md`.

## Registration

- M02 register: **email, password, role only** on `User`.
- **Additional Client and Pilot fields** will come later (Figma + M03/M04). Do not add role-specific register fields without updating the data model docs and `DESIGN_AND_FORMS_ROADMAP.md`.
- See ADR-010.
